<title>USA: KFX retains Bluestone Capital as adviser.</title>
<headline>KFX retains Bluestone Capital as adviser.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>KFX Inc said on Wednesday it has retained BlueStone Capital Partners LP, an investment bank and brokerage firm, to act as its financial adviser and merger and acquisition adviser.</p>
<p>BlueStone Capital will evaluate the financing alternatives available for future expansion and development, KFX said.</p>
</text>
